<title>USA: U.S. coffee roastings lower in latest week.</title>
<headline>U.S. coffee roastings lower in latest week.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Complete Coffee Coverage reported U.S. green coffee roastings as follows:</p>
<p>For the week ended Dec 21, roastings totaled about 465,000 60-kg bags, down from 475,000 bags the previous week and compared to 360,000 bags in the corresponding week one year ago.</p>
<p>Cumulative roastings totaled 17,500,000 bags versus 16,780,000 in the same year-ago period.</p>
<p>--New York Commodities Desk 212-859-1640</p>
